      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, for some reason I see this filed as a bug with the VRChat website. \n\nFor one handed controller support this will be fixed in the next update. \n\nFor the ability to look at Quest avatars over 10mb, the unmodified SDK refuses to upload Quest avatar over 10mb, so much so there are people that get message saying 10.00MB is over 10.00MB and therefore too big.\n\nAnyone uploading quest avatars over ten megs was likely violating the TOS by using a modified SDK to upload to the server...",
